[{"client_msg_id":"dc6f8bc6-a1c7-4ef3-9952-e6cc443efb5e","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003c#C017R65BY2J|tech-ci\u003e でやりたいと思います","ts":"1619860036.232500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aSsA2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f2bb6c5-da57-434a-8059-e1ae8e56a903","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"えぇ、そっちだとは私も思ってます…","ts":"1619860013.232100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qimO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed6e5130-f83d-44f7-92b4-5619adead953","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"逆に考えましょう、CI環境に問題があるんだろう(ビルド方法や導入にはあまり問題がないだろう)と...\nが、きりわけられた","ts":"1619859937.231700","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1619860160.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U12LS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3d2b6bd-05d3-4376-997d-b8e9817d9ad0","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"これ、検証のために、ローカルでビルドしたら通りました… うぐぐ…","ts":"1619859556.230900","thread_ts":"1619588689.165200","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K08m"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"17533fff-f93d-4529-95b9-db4727a6d678","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"Windows の gVim で `call dein#check_update()` すると、アップデート一覧が出る前に gVim ごと落ちるんですが、同じ現象にあたったことある人居ませんか？","ts":"1619588689.165200","thread_ts":"1619588689.165200","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iXTlR"}]}},{"type":"message","user":"U020J9FQ26R","text":"\u003c@U020J9FQ26R\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1619834233.230700","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"04CC2C86-9750-4FF6-87D6-42D64C8F4B98","type":"message","user":"UA1GWETAA","text":"なるほどー\n何か実害があった訳ではないのですが、スッキリしました。ありがとうございます！","ts":"1619819852.230400","edited":{"user":"UA1GWETAA","ts":"1619823101.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"blob_tada","count":1,"users":["U01H161HVPS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"liGzh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"443a5c83-aa37-4808-9b89-b683bcb48f42","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"なので `smartcase` の適用対象外になって `ignorecase` がオンのままになるのかと","ts":"1619802577.227900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v=gqR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e28ca86-b49e-46b4-9d35-b665db3905f6","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"パターンが大文字を持つか判定する処理で、特別な意味の有無に関わらず `\\x` はスキップされるみたい\n\u003chttps://github.com/vim/vim/blob/aeed2a6359e9ca692e1397884c3678685132d360/src/search.c#L450\u003e","ts":"1619802529.227200","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: vim/vim","id":1,"title":"vim/vim","title_link":"https://github.com/vim/vim/blob/aeed2a6359e9ca692e1397884c3678685132d360/src/search.c#L450","text":"The official Vim repository. Contribute to vim/vim development by creating an account on GitHub.","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/767b27b5c71936f392a6b36f1f57b7278c82e3cf7eaf7c38c9eab1466ab4c2bd/vim/vim","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/vim/vim/blob/aeed2a6359e9ca692e1397884c3678685132d360/src/search.c#L450","original_url":"https://github.com/vim/vim/blob/aeed2a6359e9ca692e1397884c3678685132d360/src/search.c#L450"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ja/3H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a44534c-0153-4ece-81f9-dc1a7ee9e862","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"ヘルプに説明はなさそうですね","ts":"1619802407.226000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=MpZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04c1dc6b-a391-4f9a-9ff9-7f08b67b961b","type":"message","user":"UA1GWETAA","text":"検索のときに気になった動きがあったので質問なのですが、 `gvim.exe -Nu NONE -c \"set incsearch smartcase ignorecase hlsearch\"` で起動したvimで\n\ngggGGGgggという文字列に対して\n`/ggggggggg` : ヒットする\n`/GGGGGGGGG` : ヒットしない\n`/\\G\\G\\G\\G\\G\\G\\G\\G\\G` : ヒットする(!?)\n\nとなったのですが、一番最後の動作についてどこかヘルプにのっていたりしますかね？？ バックスラッシュを付けても無意味な組み合わせ( `\\G` とか `\\Q` とか) だと smartcaseかつignorecase の状態でも大文字小文字無視されるみたいなんですよ。","ts":"1619797704.225600","edited":{"user":"UA1GWETAA","ts":"1619797729.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SqeD"}]}]
